{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122998","id":4395142965,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBfiPNQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122998","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122998.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122998.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122998","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122998/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122998/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122998/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/088da7da3b0b7826ef2714dabeae0ab453cefc33","number":122998,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"RenderingDevice: Fix the optional second argument in `_shader_create_from_spirv()` not being passed to `shader_create_from_spirv()`","user":{"login":"Listwon","id":1554127,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NTQxMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1554127?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Listwon","html_url":"https://github.com/Listwon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Listwon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Listwon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Listwon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Listwon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Listwon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Listwon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Listwon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Listwon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Listwon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"…\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- [shader_create_from_spirv()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_renderingdevice.html#class-renderingdevice-method-shader-create-from-spirv) method in RenderingDevice accepts the optional second argument to set the shader name. Internally it wasn't passed further so the name was never set.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n```gdscript\r\n@export shader_file: RDShaderFile \r\n\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n  var spirv: RDShaderSPIRV = shader_file.get_spirv()\r\n  var rd: RenderingDevice = RenderingServer.get_rendering_device()\r\n  var shader_name = \"TestShaderName\"\r\n  var shader_rid = rd.shader_create_from_spirv(spirv, shader_name)\r\n```\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.